    <p class="mb-4">
      Determining your size requires precision. Start with a soft measuring tape. First, take your band measurement snugly directly under your bust. Next, take your bust measurement loosely around the fullest part of your chest. For detailed placement diagrams and visual instructions, explore our step-by-step <a href="/how-to-measure" class="text-primary font-semibold hover:underline">How to Measure Guide</a>. You can calculate in inches or centimeters—whichever unit system you prefer.
